        Neighbors of 3 are [1]
        1 is already visited
        Dead end! Return back to vertex 1

Step 4: Back at vertex 1
        Next unvisited neighbor is 4
        Visit 4
        Print "4"
        Mark 4 as visited
        Neighbors of 4 are [1]
        1 is already visited
        Dead end! Return back to vertex 1

Step 5: All neighbors of 1 are explored
        Return back to vertex 0

Step 6: Back at vertex 0
