                continue
            heapq.heappush(open_heap, nb)

Generate all neighboring states (valid moves from current state).
For each neighbor:
  - If its board configuration is already in closed set, skip it
    (we've already found the optimal path to this configuration)
  - Otherwise, add to the open heap for future exploration
  - heapq will sort it based on its priority (f value)


PRINT BOARD FUNCTION

