        edges.sort(key=lambda x: x[2])

Sort all edges by their weight (third element of each edge tuple).
lambda x: x[2] is an anonymous function that returns the third element.
  Edge format: (u, v, weight)
  x[0] = u (start vertex)
  x[1] = v (end vertex)
  x[2] = weight  <-- sort by this


