  /proc/cpuinfo: Virtual file containing CPU information
  (vmx|svm): Look for either "vmx" (Intel) or "svm" (AMD)
  -c: Count matching lines (not show them)
  If output is 0: CPU doesn't support virtualization or it's disabled in BIOS.
